The core trait in rho-ai defines provider-agnostic LLM communication: #[async_trait]
pub trait LlmService: Send + Sync { fn chat_stream( &self, request: LlmRequest, ) -> Result<EventStream, ProviderError>;
} All providers implement this trait. The agent loop consumes the EventStream (a Pin<Box<dyn Stream<Item = Result<StreamEvent>>>>) for streaming responses.

